OL,3,GNEWSAFormer swimming coach jailed for
OL,4,A15 and a half years for sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Irish national swimming coach
OL,7,Fhas been sentenced to 15 and a half
OL,8,Fyears for sexually abusing girls in the
OL,9,F1970s and 1980s.
OL,11,FIn July, a jury found him guilty of 39
OL,12,Fcounts of indecent assault and one
OL,13,Fcount of attempted rape.
OL,15,FJudge Micheal P O Higgins described him
OL,16,Fas a "manipulative predator" and said
OL,17,Fthe abuse was systematic and predatory
OL,18,Fin nature.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
